# Secrets — Meta Marketing API + advertising status bearer
# Glob, not the bare name: `.env.meta.bak` was NOT covered by `.env.meta` and sat
# untracked-but-committable with 6 live tokens in it (META_ACCESS_TOKEN,
# META_CAPI_TOKEN, ADVERTISING_STATUS_BEARER). One `git add -A` would have pushed
# them to a public remote, where a secret is compromised even if the commit is
# rewritten afterwards.
.env.meta*

# Editor/tooling backups of any env file — same trap as above.
.env*.bak
*.env.bak
